21
00:01:17,408 --> 00:01:21,125
Open its run if you need to confirm
which suite it executed.

22
00:01:21,679 --> 00:01:24,274
If the checks are pending, wait for the
result.

23
00:01:24,877 --> 00:01:29,491
If the author pushes again, refresh the
diff and checks for the new head before

24
00:01:29,491 --> 00:01:30,797
making your decision.

25
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:35,347
Here’s the alternate outcome. The checks
are green,

26
00:01:35,641 --> 00:01:40,111
but the test added in this version
exercises one and never calls the

27
00:01:40,111 --> 00:01:41,424
