of what you verified.

35
00:02:07,621 --> 00:02:11,763
Submit the review from your account,
then read back the reviews on the pull

36
00:02:11,763 --> 00:02:12,413
request.

37
00:02:12,737 --> 00:02:16,015
Confirm your decision was saved to the
intended request.

38
00:02:17,801 --> 00:02:22,642
Pair up and swap author and reviewer
roles. Give each reviewer an issue,

39
00:02:22,867 --> 00:02:25,213
a pull request, and the check results.

40
00:02:25,661 --> 00:02:29,167
In one run, the evidence is complete. In
the other,

41
00:02:29,370 --> 00:02:31,483
leave out the test for the key input.

42
00:02:32,155 --> 00:02:35,531
Ask the reviewer to explain their
decision in one sentence.

43
00:02:36,133 --> 00:02:39,972
It should tell the author what was
verified or what needs to change.
